--- !u!114 &583986706
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 583986703}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 72dcd122254073845a271b4898476ffc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MuseumTerminalDisplay
  pages:
  - title: I. THE METABOLIC LEAP
    eraCode: LOWER PALEOLITHIC // 1.500.000 B.C.
    bodyText: 'By striking flint against pyrite, early Terrans sparked controlled

      exothermic reactions. Fire externalized digestion, shrinking the gut

      and diverting immense metabolic caloric energy directly into the neocortex.'
  - title: II. THE METALLURGIC FORGE
    eraCode: BRONZE & IRON AGE // 3.300 B.C.
    bodyText: 'Humans tamed the crucible. Smelting copper, tin, and iron ore

      from Earth''s mantle, they transformed brittle stones into tools

      of agriculture, monumental architecture, and celestial measurement.'
  - title: III. THE THINKING STONE
    eraCode: INFORMATION AGE // 2026 A.D.
    bodyText: 'In a poetic planetary loop, humanity returned to common sand.

      Purifying quartz into monocrystalline silicon and carving nanometer gates,

      Terrans taught the melted rock of their cradle planet how to think.'
  - title: DIVE PROTOCOL // WORLD 2
    eraCode: SENSORY 6DoF IMMERSION READY
    bodyText: 'Full VR world transition available: The Forge of Civilization.


      Reach out and grasp the Living Terran Sphere, or press the DIVE PEDESTAL to pull the flame into your consciousness and enter the Prehistoric Mountain Forge.'
  currentPageIndex: 0
  titleTextMesh: {fileID: 751448539}
  bodyTextMesh: {fileID: 1083959070}
  footerTextMesh: {fileID: 2001015077}
  terminalScreenLight: {fileID: 2077145233}
  audioSource: {fileID: 583986705}
  switchPageClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f9a879c27c464e6439a51ed5d6159d7a, type: 3}
